Midgard color attachment LOAD preloads via injected wallpaper tiler jobs.

Use modern internal shader caching, image view texture payloads and descriptor
pools, following the maintained Gallium v5 preloader's job and varying layout.
Propagate allocation/compile failures to command recording; do not apply
Bifrost frame shader descriptors on Midgard. Z/S, MSAA, layered and formats
requiring shader blending remain explicitly unsupported.

